title: On the Campaign Trail
subtitle: A Chancellor election is coming, and every moment counts.
tags: event
view-if: trail_ready and not finale and not game_ending
priority: 1
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_holonet.svg
on-arrival: {! SW.trailOpen(Q); !}

= [+ tr_title +]

[? if trail_kind = "debate" : The HoloNet hosts a debate ahead of the Chancellor election. [+ tr_speaker +] will speak for the Caucus[? if tr_has_rival : , facing [+ tr_rival_name +] of the [+ tr_rival_bloc +]?]. ?]

[? if trail_kind = "endorse" : [+ tr_pitch +] An endorsement from [+ tr_endorser_name +] would carry weight. [+ tr_price +] ?]

[? if trail_kind = "research" : Our researchers have found a sealed file on the campaign finances of [+ tr_rival_name +] of the [+ tr_rival_bloc +]. [? if tr_rival_pal and evidence < 3 : Without more evidence of our own, a leak against Palpatine will look like a smear. ?] ?]

[? if trail_kind = "gaffe" : A Caucus senator, caught on an open microphone, [+ tr_gaffe_text +]. The clip is everywhere by morning, and the [+ tr_gaffe_region_name +] is not amused. ?]

[? if trail_kind = "smear" : A HoloNet feed carries documents purporting to show a Caucus senator taking money from Separatist sympathisers. The documents are very good, almost too good. Someone with resources wants the Caucus on the back foot before the election. ?]

- @db_reform: Make it about clean government and reform.
- @db_rim: Speak for the Rim.
- @db_security: Promise order and security.
- @db_attack: Go after [+ tr_rival_name +]'s record.
- @en_accept: Accept the endorsement.
- @en_ask: Ask the Jedi anyway.
- @en_decline: [? if tr_jedi : Respect the Order's neutrality. ?][? if not tr_jedi : Politely decline. ?]
- @rs_publish: Leak it.
- @rs_hold: Keep it, and let them know we have it.
- @rs_burn: Burn it. The Caucus does not fight that way.
- @gf_apologise: Apologise at once.
- @gf_double: Double down.
- @gf_ignore: Say nothing and wait for it to pass.
- @sm_rebut: Rebut it with the facts.
- @sm_counter: Accuse Palpatine's people of planting it.
- @sm_ignore: Ignore it.

@db_reform
view-if: trail_kind = "debate"
subtitle: [? if corruption > 60 : The Senate's corruption makes this a strong message. ?][? if corruption <= 60 : A worthy message, but not the galaxy's main worry. ?] Wins the Moderates and Independents.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'reform'); !}
go-to: debate_result

@db_rim
view-if: trail_kind = "debate"
subtitle: [? if rim_hardship > 40 : The Rim is suffering: this will resonate. ?][? if rim_hardship <= 40 : The Rim is not in crisis, so this may fall flat. ?] Wins the Rim; the Moderates bristle.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'rim'); !}
go-to: debate_result

@db_security
view-if: trail_kind = "debate"
subtitle: [? if fear > 45 : A frightened galaxy wants to hear this. ?][? if fear <= 45 : In calm times this sounds like fearmongering. ?] Wins the Security Bloc; the Pacifists dislike it.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'security'); !}
go-to: debate_result

@db_attack
view-if: trail_kind = "debate" and tr_has_rival
subtitle: [? if tr_rival_pal and evidence < 3 : Risky without evidence: Palpatine is very good at playing the victim. ?][? if not tr_rival_pal or evidence >= 3 : Hurts their standing with every bloc if it lands. ?]
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'attack'); !}
go-to: debate_result

@debate_result

[? if tr_won : [+ tr_speaker +] is superb: sharp, warm and in command of the facts. The HoloNet's pundits call the debate for the Caucus. ?][? if not tr_won : [+ tr_speaker +] has a poor night: halting answers, a fumbled statistic, a rival who seemed to know every question in advance. ?]

@en_accept
view-if: trail_kind = "endorse" and not tr_jedi
subtitle: [+ tr_price +]
choose-if: capital >= 1 or tr_endorser != "moncal"
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital for the visit.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'accept'); !}

[+ tr_endorser_name +] endorses the Caucus before the cameras. It is the lead story on the HoloNet for a day, and the Caucus's momentum rises.

@en_ask
view-if: trail_kind = "endorse" and tr_jedi
subtitle: The Order will refuse, and our friends in the Temple will be embarrassed.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'accept'); !}

Master Yoda receives our envoy kindly and sends them away with nothing. "Serve the Republic, the Jedi do. Serve a party, we do not." Word of the request gets out.

@en_decline
view-if: trail_kind = "endorse"
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'decline'); !}

[? if tr_jedi : The Caucus leaves the Jedi out of politics. Our friends in the Temple notice, and are grateful. ?][? if not tr_jedi : The Caucus thanks [+ tr_endorser_name +] and keeps its distance. ?]

@rs_publish
view-if: trail_kind = "research"
subtitle: Hurts their standing with every bloc. The Institutionalists dislike dirty campaigns.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'publish'); !}

[? if tr_won : The file reaches the HoloNet through a friendly journalist. [+ tr_rival_name +]'s campaign spends a week explaining itself. ?][? if not tr_won : The leak is traced back to the Caucus within hours. Palpatine's dignified reply makes us look like bullies. ?]

@rs_hold
view-if: trail_kind = "research"
subtitle: The [+ tr_rival_bloc +] will be quietly more accommodating.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'hold'); !}

A discreet word is passed to the [+ tr_rival_bloc +]. Nothing is said aloud. Nothing needs to be.

@rs_burn
view-if: trail_kind = "research"
subtitle: A little faith in politics, and calmer Institutionalists.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'burn'); !}

The file goes into the incinerator. Word gets around that the Caucus had it and chose not to use it.

@gf_apologise
subtitle: A small loss of momentum.
view-if: trail_kind = "gaffe"
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'apologise'); !}

The senator apologises before the cameras, and the story dies within a day.

@gf_double
subtitle: Some voters like bluntness. Most do not.
view-if: trail_kind = "gaffe"
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'double'); !}

[? if tr_won : The senator refuses to apologise, and a surprising number of voters admire the candour. ?][? if not tr_won : The senator refuses to apologise and makes it worse. The [+ tr_gaffe_bloc_name +] demand the Caucus disown the remark. ?]

@gf_ignore
subtitle: The story may run for a week.
view-if: trail_kind = "gaffe"
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'ignore'); !}

The Caucus says nothing. The HoloNet replays the clip for a week.

@sm_rebut
view-if: trail_kind = "smear"
subtitle: −1 political capital. [? if evidence >= 2 : Our investigators can show the documents are forged, and trace where they came from. ?][? if evidence < 2 : Without investigators of our own, a rebuttal may not convince. ?]
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'rebut'); !}

[? if tr_won : Our investigators take the forgery apart, line by line, and find the trail behind it leads somewhere interesting. ?][? if not tr_won : Our rebuttal is drowned out. The documents look real, and the denial sounds like every other denial. ?]

@sm_counter
view-if: trail_kind = "smear"
subtitle: [? if evidence >= 4 : We have enough to make it stick. ?][? if evidence < 4 : Without hard evidence this will look like paranoia. ?]
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'counter'); !}

[? if tr_won : The Caucus names the shell company that paid for the forgery, and its links to the Chancellery's friends. The story turns. ?][? if not tr_won : The accusation lands badly: the Caucus looks rattled, and Palpatine looks wounded. ?]

@sm_ignore
view-if: trail_kind = "smear"
subtitle: The smear will hang over the Caucus for months.
on-arrival: {! SW.trailResolve(Q, 'ignore'); !}

The Caucus refuses to dignify the story. The story does not need its dignity.
